      "writtenOn": "2024-02-06T05:35:05Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I\u0027m sorry but it seems that I missed relevant discussion thread. Could you share me about creating an extra DT?\n\nIMHO, we can send the same option via VM reference DT dtbo. `virtmgr` generates it anyway, so we can append extra data there.\n\nEven we separate DT here, `crosvm` will merge all DT together so neither `pvmfw` nor `microdroid` can\u0027t distinguish whether it was specified via VM reference DT nor an extra DT. If you feel bad about having extra data to reference DT, then you can just rename `reference_dt.*` to `extra_dt.*` (or something similar)",
      "range": {
